Question 5 - Login User
=======================

API Endpoint:
POST https://ynt4-cars-dealership.onrender.com/djangoapp/login

Prerequisites:
- A registered Django user account
- A valid CSRF cookie and token obtained from /djangoapp/csrf/
- The same cookie jar must be used for CSRF and login

cURL Command:

curl -sS \
  -b cookies.txt -c cookies.txt \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "Referer: https://ynt4-cars-dealership.onrender.com/" \
  -H "X-CSRFToken: ${CSRF_TOKEN}" \
  --data '{"userName":"capstone_test_1794539573","password":"REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"}' \
  https://ynt4-cars-dealership.onrender.com/djangoapp/login

